  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿母ê手工sap-bûn"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蕭立慧</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隨入門就鼻著一tsūn一tsūn ê芳味，客廳、桌頂、塗跤囥kah規sì-kè，lóng是一塊一塊ê手工sap-bûn，阿母講：「Khah細膩--leh，m̄-thang去踏--著。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮三个姐弟仔飛出鳥仔siū，兩个老--ê tsiú tī雲林庄跤，阿爸身體khah bái，逐年lóng ke減ē破病、入院，阿母操心peh腹，ē去烏白想，其實歡頭喜面也一工，憂頭kat面也一工，suà--落ê日子beh按怎過tsiah ē快活？有一工，親tsiânn送伊一塊sap-bûn，化工味siunn重，洗--起-來koh澀澀、ta燥ta燥ê款，tshiāng拄tshiāng，社區大學有手工sap-bûn ê課程，伊就想beh家己來舞看māi。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「做手工sap-bûn tsiânn費氣，ài tshuân橄欖油（kan-ná-iû）、椰子油、棕樹油、氫氧化鈉、皂模……koh ài照比例去調。」阿母喙笑目笑沓沓仔講，手koh比來畫去，bē輸青春ê少年家仔，m̄-koh，阮三姐弟仔kah阿爸lóng認為阿母kan-na頭燒燒尾冷冷，過--無-幾-工就家己放棄--ah。頭先做--出-來ê模仔無夠suí，阿母就去網路頂kuân買百百樣ê模仔，來試看māi佗一款khah suí，發覺橄欖油無夠滑，伊就改用成本khah kuân ê甜杏仁油；想beh用到手芳（tò-tshiú-phang）ê芳味，就tī門跤口種一欉到手芳；見擺，倒氫氧化鈉ê溫度tsiânn kuân koh危險，阿母lóng規身軀khàm-tiâu-tiâu，面罩、喙am、長ńg ê衫、長褲，阿爸看--著lóng笑伊是伊斯蘭教ê信徒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿母就是tsit款頂真ê個性，有心拍鐵鐵tsiânn針，伊顧手工sap-bûn ná leh顧囡仔，皂化ài兩個月ê時間，伊就不管時去巡--一-下，koh kā in kah被、kah in講話。阿母ê sap-bûn無紅kì-kì ê色水，kan-na自然ê色緻，摸--起-來tsa̍t-tsinn，鼻--起-來清芳清芳，伊ê sap-bûn是做來交朋友送親tsiânn--ê，kan-na送無leh賣。有建設公司ê董--ê，beh kā阿母出價，價siàu凊彩阿母huah，阿母講tsia-ê sap-bûn無價--lah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">嫁來高雄已經12冬--ah，逐年tńg去庄跤幾斗kan-na用tsíng頭仔就算ē出--來。阿母無慣勢後生查某囝lóng無tī身軀邊，心內難免有怨嘆，tiānn-tiānn講某mí人ê囝無出脫，閒閒tī厝無頭路，m̄-koh ē-sái tī爸母身軀邊，囝m̄免siunn gâu，siunn gâu就ē飛--出-去--ah。唸bóng唸，阿母ê心是ǹg--阮--ê，只要阮過了幸福快樂，伊就心滿意足，伊kā全部ê心意lóng囥入去手工sap-bûn，龜毛、kāu-kāu唸、厚操煩、骨力……就親像伊對sap-bûn ê堅持。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鼻著sap-bûn ê芳味，hōo我koh想起阿母，今仔日tshuā囡仔來去庄跤se̍h-se̍h--leh，門跤口hit欉到手芳該然抽kuân--起-來--ah。&nbsp;</span></p><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAR2MRfL5FitFqUvvwNlyRCFUn3p8x09hCZSc-AO-UMcnTzsCcilodSD_SowyGhg-DHfigBZJ0bmlja934clc3RGKOAtx-PeTg3ibHjYqRLC0aN0MVq9jHFRUrPXt5dF6GxplBboKIYL_0hFOhJ4MTkoaDGNPtq0v4mcTn75rxZeiNzn-tLBn4vwl_c5Io/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_35.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiAR2MRfL5FitFqUvvwNlyRCFUn3p8x09hCZSc-AO-UMcnTzsCcilodSD_SowyGhg-DHfigBZJ0bmlja934clc3RGKOAtx-PeTg3ibHjYqRLC0aN0MVq9jHFRUrPXt5dF6GxplBboKIYL_0hFOhJ4MTkoaDGNPtq0v4mcTn75rxZeiNzn-tLBn4vwl_c5Io/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_35.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2lJp-l2N_jWL2qn2YWqhVz4HIwqaBAAu1MYxggLzyLxBlRVmaf6jlb-7p1I5XG6PTrq4NqZunfNhUygemuRoPjUwUMHg7r1fXNI9mIRTz-DxBZYoTW4h7oUf88w5wO7VgJ1EVHaQN7omQyZiNlPqWNSTuU1dDHoDeaO5cRsgv00tekP2rZq9EGfCVTTQJ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1362%E6%9C%9F_34_A.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2l